{"id":556,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自立学習とSTEAM探究を結ぶ理工系一貫教育","feature_description":"芝浦工業大学附属中学校は、授業と自立学習SD、SHIBAURA探究を連携させた中高一貫教育を行います。SDでは学んだ内容を振り返り、発表などのアウトプットで定着を図ります。IT・GC・総合探究ではデザイン思考やグローバルな視点を取り入れ、チームで課題に取り組みます。大学との連携によるSTEAM教育や三つの言語教育も通じ、理工系の知識を社会課題の解決に生かす力を育てます。","clubs":[{"id":10578,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fzk.shibaura-it.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10579,"name":"中学バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fzk.shibaura-it.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10580,"name":"中学サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fzk.shibaura-it.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10581,"name":"中学硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fzk.shibaura-it.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10582,"name":"理科部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fzk.shibaura-it.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10583,"name":"電子技術研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fzk.shibaura-it.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":10584,"name":"工作技術研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fzk.shibaura-it.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13034,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fzk.shibaura-it.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13035,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fzk.shibaura-it.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13036,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fzk.shibaura-it.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13037,"name":"ゴルフ部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fzk.shibaura-it.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13038,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fzk.shibaura-it.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2